---
//About.astro
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '@/components/base/ExternalLink.astro';

const pageTitle = 'About';
const pageDescription = `Bio of Flipse`;
---

<BaseLayout hasOwnTitle={true} pageTitle={pageTitle} pageDescription={pageDescription}>
    <h1>Hey, so I'm Flipse, or whatever.</h1>
    <article class="prose flow">
        <p>
            <b>Just kidding, there's nothing nonchalant about me.</b>{' '}
            A late-30s nerd of music and [insert current obsession]. Disability retired, but occasionally
            doing NASA's{' '}
            <ExternalLink href="https://science.nasa.gov/citizen-science/" label="homework" /> and picking
            fights with quantum physics just for kicks. I will recite the entire script of the 1998 hit
            movie <em>Armageddon</em> if I like you. The 'tism is strong with this one.
        </p>

        <p>
            I'm a cis bisexual woman from Denmark, my pronouns are she/her. I dig live music,
            D&amp;D, <dfn title="The smell of rain hitting warm ground, pavement, and asphalt"
                >petrichor</dfn
            >, and desk setups. If you wanna check out <em>my</em> setup, you can do so here on my
            {' '}<a class="prose-link" href="/uses">/uses</a> page.
        </p>

        <h2>Chronically online since 1999</h2>
        <p>
            I right-clicked <em>view source</em> sometime around 1999 and got my own domain quickly after.
            I was blogging and coding and making online friends I still have to this day. The Lord of
            the Rings and Livejournal were my introduction to fandoms, I made graphics and terrible websites
            and it was wonderful.
        </p>

        <p>
            I arrived at Tumblr in the summer of 2009, and I have after 15+ years of creating and
            publishing <ExternalLink
                href="https://mournstera.tumblr.com/"
                label="Tumblr themes"
            />, left that behind. I am now here. Back to carving my own corner, my own <em>haus</em
            > on the big web.
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    dfn {
        font-style: normal;
        cursor: help;
    }
</style>
